('200127','2003','Al Ain Palace Museum','Al Ain Palace Museum','The former residence associated with Sheikh Zayed and the Al Nahyan family, preserved as a palace museum of domestic and political life in Al Ain.','1-1.5 hours','Morning','Do not route travelers here until the official renovation closure is lifted.','','Abu Dhabi','0','0','','','Closed for renovation',4.4,4.3,24.2168,55.7617,'Hessa bint Mohammed Street, Central District, Al Ain','https://abudhabiculture.ae/en/cultural-sites/museums/al-ain-palace-museum',0.4,'2026-10-01 12:00:00',NULL,'attraction',NULL,'budget','na','own','2026-10-01 16:00:00','verified','CURRENT STATUS verified 2026-10-01: Abu Dhabi Culture/DCT continues to state that Al Ain Palace Museum is temporarily closed for renovation (closure began 1 Jul 2024). Legacy opening hours elsewhere are not current. [Primary: abudhabiculture.ae / dct.gov.ae]','2026-10-01'),
