('200417','2009','Al Bidya Mosque','Al Bidya Mosque','Historic four-domed mosque in Al Bidya, continuously used for worship and one of Fujairah''s most important heritage sites.','45-60 minutes','Morning','Dress modestly and allow time to climb toward the nearby watchtowers for coastal views.','','Fujairah','1','0','6:00 AM','','Free; active mosque',4.9,4.8,25.438975,56.353592,'Al Bidya, Fujairah','https://tourism.fujairah.ae/destinations/al-bidya-mosque',0.97,'2026-10-01 12:00:00',NULL,'attraction',NULL,'budget','na','own','2026-10-01 12:00:00','verified','Fujairah Tourism''s latest research-based page dates the mosque to about 1599 CE (±9 years) and currently lists 8:00 AM-6:00 PM. The federal tourism page still carries an older 1446 date; this row follows Fujairah''s newer cited study and notes the dating conflict. [Sources: tourism.fujairah.ae; UAE federal tourism]','2026-10-01'),
