('200612','2014','Dreamland Aqua Park','Dreamland Aqua Park','Large family water park with slides, pools, dry sports, mini-zoo facilities and landscaped recreation areas.','Full day','Morning','Arrive at opening and confirm any seasonal ride maintenance before purchasing tickets.','','Umm Al Quwain','0','0','','','Official rate AED 200 adult (>120 cm); AED 150 junior (80-120 cm); under 80 cm free; seniors 65+ free with ID',4.8,4.6,25.58925,55.66,'Etihad Road, Umm Al Quwain','https://dreamlanduae.com/',0.93,'2026-10-01 12:00:00',NULL,'attraction',NULL,'budget','na','own','2026-10-01 12:00:00','verified','Official Dreamland site currently states 10:00 AM-6:00 PM every day. Official admission page publishes AED200 adult and AED150 junior base rates; operating schedule/rates may change. [Sources: dreamlanduae.com; booking.dreamlanduae.com]','2026-10-01'),
('200613','2014','Kite Beach Center UAQ','Kite Beach Center UAQ','Private beach and watersports center offering swimming, kayaking, SUP, kitesurfing, beach seating and food.','Half day','Morning','Check current entry rules and activity availability before traveling, especially for kitesurfing or pets.','','Umm Al Quwain','0','0','','','Paid private beach; entry/activity pricing changes by day and season',4.7,4.6,25.5473,55.53695,'Al Midan, Umm Al Quwain','https://www.kitebeachcenter.ae/',0.9,'2026-10-01 12:00:00',NULL,'attraction',NULL,'budget','na','own','2026-10-01 12:00:00','partial','Kite Beach Center''s current ordering page confirms the UAQ operation and restaurant; current third-party 2026 sources disagree on center-wide operating hours/pricing, so entry rules remain PARTIAL. Coordinates confirmed by OpenStreetMap/Mapcarta. [Sources: kitebeachcenter.ae/order page; Mapcarta; 2026 local listings]','2026-10-01'),
('200614','2014','Kite Beach Center Restaurant & Cafe','Kite Beach Center Restaurant & Cafe','Beachfront cafe serving breakfast, lunch and dinner alongside the Kite Beach Center watersports area.','1-1.5 hours','Morning','Good for breakfast before paddling or a relaxed meal after beach activities.','','Umm Al Quwain','0','0','','','Menu-priced; casual mid-range beach dining',4.3,4.4,25.5473,55.53695,'Kite Beach Center, Umm Al Quwain','https://kitebeachcenter.mobi-order.com/',0.8,'2026-10-01 12:00:00',NULL,'restaurant','International / Cafe / Seafood','mid','veg-options','own','2026-10-01 12:00:00','partial','Current first-party ordering page says breakfast/lunch/dinner and lists 7 AM-11 PM daily, while the current claimed Tripadvisor page shows 7 AM-10 PM. Store PARTIAL and reconfirm live before publication. [Sources: kitebeachcenter.mobi-order.com; Tripadvisor 2026]','2026-10-01'),
('200615','2014','Umm Al Quwain Marine Club','Umm Al Quwain Marine Club','Marine-sports club associated with sailing, windsurfing, waterskiing and other coastal recreation.','2-4 hours','Morning','Contact the club before arrival because activity availability and launch conditions are weather dependent.','Contact/booking recommended','Umm Al Quwain','0','0','','','Activity/membership pricing varies',4.4,4.4,25.5745,55.5607,'Sheikh Ahmed Bin Rashid Al Mualla Road, Umm Al Quwain','https://www.uaqmarineclub.com/',0.81,'2026-10-01 12:00:00',NULL,'attraction',NULL,'budget','na','own','2026-10-01 12:00:00','partial','The official UAE government tourism platform explicitly identifies Umm Al Quwain Marine Club for windsurfing, waterskiing and sailing. Current public activity hours/prices were not verified from the club site, so PARTIAL. [Source: u.ae]','2026-10-01'),
('200616','2014','Umm Al Quwain Public Beach & Corniche','Umm Al Quwain Public Beach & Corniche','Relaxed public coastline and waterfront walking area with broad Gulf views and sunset scenery.','2-3 hours','Evening','Use designated swimming areas and follow local sea-condition or lifeguard notices.','','Umm Al Quwain','0','1','','6:00 PM','Free public waterfront',4.5,4.5,25.5732,55.5548,'Umm Al Quwain waterfront','https://visituaq.ae/',0.85,'2026-10-01 12:00:00',NULL,'attraction',NULL,'budget','na','own','2026-10-01 12:00:00','partial','Federal and emirate tourism material consistently promote UAQ''s beaches and coastline. No single official page captured a consolidated public-beach timetable, so access is represented as open public waterfront with safety caveats. [Sources: u.ae; visituaq.ae]','2026-10-01'),
('200617','2014','Palma Saray Restaurant & Cafe','Palma Saray Restaurant & Cafe','Waterfront Arabic and international restaurant at Palma Beach Resort with indoor, outdoor and floating dining areas.','1.5-2 hours','Evening','Reserve for waterfront seating on weekends.','Reservation recommended','Umm Al Quwain','0','0','','','Mid-range to premium; menu priced',4.4,4.5,25.5667,55.5665,'Palma Beach Resort, Al Khor 1, Umm Al Quwain','https://palmabeachuaq.com/dining/',0.82,'2026-10-01 12:00:00',NULL,'restaurant','Arabic / International / Grill','mid','veg-options','own','2026-10-01 12:00:00','partial','Official Palma Beach Resort site confirms Palma Saray and floating-area dining. Current listings consistently show around 9 AM-2 AM daily, but exact hours were not published on the captured first-party dining page, so PARTIAL. [Sources: palmabeachuaq.com; current 2026 listings]','2026-10-01'),
('200618','2014','UAQ Beach Hotel Restaurant','UAQ Beach Hotel Restaurant','Beach-hotel restaurant serving Lebanese, Arabic and Middle Eastern dishes near the Al Raas waterfront.','1-1.5 hours','Evening','Useful casual dinner stop after Kite Beach or the southern waterfront.','','Umm Al Quwain','0','0','','','Approx AED 110 for two on current listing',4.0,4.1,25.5491,55.5386,'UAQ Beach Hotel, Al Raas, Umm Al Quwain','',0.72,'2026-10-01 12:00:00',NULL,'restaurant','Lebanese / Arabic / Middle Eastern','mid','veg-options','own','2026-10-01 12:00:00','partial','Current restaurant listing shows Lebanese/Arabic/Middle Eastern cuisine and 11 AM-midnight daily. No first-party restaurant page was captured, so PARTIAL. [Source: current restaurant listing]','2026-10-01'),
('200619','2015','Falaj Al Mualla Fort Museum','Falaj Al Mualla Fort Museum','Restored early-19th-century fort museum with archaeology, crafts, pearling tools, maritime displays, weapons and date-syrup heritage.','1.5-2 hours','Morning','Combine it with the nearby watchtowers and oasis landscape.','','Umm Al Quwain','0','0','','','Low-cost museum admission; current official ticket amount not captured',4.8,4.7,25.35197,55.85017,'Falaj Al Mualla, Umm Al Quwain','https://culturalmap.gov.ae/en/facilities/falaj-al-mualla-fort-museum',0.94,'2026-10-01 12:00:00',NULL,'attraction',NULL,'budget','na','own','2026-10-01 12:00:00','partial','UAE National Cultural Map confirms the fort museum, restoration/reopening and collections. Current listings conflict between continuous and split hours; no authoritative hours were exposed in the cultural-map record, so PARTIAL. Exact coordinates and licensed Commons image are verified. [Sources: culturalmap.gov.ae; Mapcarta; Wikimedia Commons]','2026-10-01'),
('200620','2015','Al Senabi Tower','Al Senabi Tower','Historic three-level circular watchtower in Falaj Al Mualla built around 1800 for surveillance and defense.','30-45 minutes','Morning','View together with Falaj Al Mualla Fort; access to the tower interior may be restricted.','','Umm Al Quwain','0','0','','','Free exterior heritage stop; interior access unverified',4.2,4.3,25.343,55.85,'Falaj Al Mualla, Umm Al Quwain','https://culturalmap.gov.ae/en/facilities/al-ssinabi-tower-al-senabi',0.78,'2026-10-01 12:00:00',NULL,'attraction',NULL,'budget','na','own','2026-10-01 12:00:00','partial','UAE National Cultural Map documents the tower''s date, construction materials and defensive role. Current interior-access hours are not published. [Source: culturalmap.gov.ae]','2026-10-01'),
('200621','2015','Falaj Al Mualla Garden Park','Falaj Al Mualla Garden Park','Green family park with walking paths, lawns, seating, sports and children''s play areas.','1.5-3 hours','Evening','Best in cooler evenings; useful as a relaxed family stop after the fort.','','Umm Al Quwain','0','0','','','Reported free/low-cost access; confirm current municipal policy',4.1,4.2,25.354,55.857,'Falaj Al Mualla, Umm Al Quwain','',0.74,'2026-10-01 12:00:00',NULL,'attraction',NULL,'budget','na','own','2026-10-01 12:00:00','partial','Current 2025-2026 park guides confirm the operating public park and family facilities. Sources disagree on historical hours; a park directory currently lists 3-9 PM daily, but no authoritative municipality page was captured. [Sources: Property Finder UAE; Trfihi park directory]','2026-10-01'),
('200622','2015','Falaj Al Mualla Oasis','Falaj Al Mualla Oasis','Historic inland oasis landscape associated with date palms, agriculture and the falaj water system that gave the town its name.','1-2 hours','Morning','Treat this as a landscape/heritage drive and respect farms and private property.','','Umm Al Quwain','0','0','','','Open landscape; no ticket',4.4,4.5,25.35033,55.85368,'Falaj Al Mualla, Umm Al Quwain','https://u.ae/en/information-and-services/visiting-and-exploring-the-uae/what-to-do-in-the-uae/explore-the-uae-by-emirate-',0.82,'2026-10-01 12:00:00',NULL,'attraction',NULL,'budget','na','own','2026-10-01 12:00:00','verified','The official UAE tourism platform describes Falaj Al Mualla as an attractive natural oasis and the UAE cultural map lists its historic falaj/heritage assets. It is not a single gated attraction. [Sources: u.ae; culturalmap.gov.ae]','2026-10-01'),
('200623','2015','Falaj Al Mualla Camel Racetrack','Falaj Al Mualla Camel Racetrack','Traditional camel-racing venue associated with the inland oasis community.','1-2 hours','Early Morning','Only visit when races or training are scheduled; there is no guaranteed daily spectator program.','','Umm Al Quwain','1','0','6:00 AM','','Event-dependent spectator access',4.0,4.1,25.381,55.9,'Falaj Al Mualla, Umm Al Quwain','https://u.ae/en/information-and-services/visiting-and-exploring-the-uae/what-to-do-in-the-uae/explore-the-uae-by-emirate-',0.7,'2026-10-01 12:00:00',NULL,'attraction',NULL,'budget','na','own','2026-10-01 12:00:00','partial','The official UAE tourism platform explicitly notes that Falaj Al Mualla has a camel racetrack. Current race/training calendar and public hours were not captured. [Source: u.ae]','2026-10-01'),
('200624','2015','Sharī‘at Falaj Al Mualla','Sharī‘at Falaj Al Mualla','Heritage water-channel and agricultural landscape representing the traditional falaj irrigation system of the oasis.','45-60 minutes','Morning','View from public paths and avoid entering farms or irrigation infrastructure without permission.','','Umm Al Quwain','0','0','','','Free outdoor heritage landscape',4.0,4.2,25.351,55.855,'Falaj Al Mualla, Umm Al Quwain','https://culturalmap.gov.ae/en/emirate/umm-al-quwain',0.72,'2026-10-01 12:00:00',NULL,'attraction',NULL,'budget','na','own','2026-10-01 12:00:00','partial','The UAE National Cultural Map explicitly lists Sharī‘at Falaj Al Mualla as a heritage site. Current visitor infrastructure/hours are not published, so it is stored as an outdoor PARTIAL heritage record. [Source: culturalmap.gov.ae]','2026-10-01');
